DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10924::$$$message_0085_0000_0000$$$::We still have some time until class starts. I'll go take a peek at the kyudo club.[lr]::
10925::$$$message_0085_0000_0001$$$::Sakura, who became the new captain, left first thing in the morning today too.::
10926::$$$message_0085_0001_0000$$$::She has her own family matters, yet she even makes my lunch at times. On top of that, she even completes her duties as a club president.[lr]::
10927::$$$message_0085_0001_0001$$$::"Miss Perfect" is a fitting name for her, but...what is this uneasiness?::
10928::$$$message_0085_0002_0000$$$::Either practice ended, or there were not many members to begin with... I only see Sakura and Mitsuzuri inside.[lr]::
10929::$$$message_0085_0002_0001$$$::I take a bow at the entrance, and just as I'm considering stepping out onto the wooden floor, I make out some distant voices and lose my opportunity to retreat.::
10930::$$$message_0085_0003_0000$$$::"...s what I think..."[lr]::
10931::$$$message_0085_0003_0001$$$::"...to say it, but that's your problem, Matou. It's not something that can be solved even if I said something, right?"[lr]::
10932::$$$message_0085_0003_0002$$$::"Yeah, you're not wrong..."::
10933::$$$message_0085_0004_0000$$$::Sakura's problem?[lr]::
10934::$$$message_0085_0004_0001$$$::It seems to be some rather complicated topic. Even I don't have the nerve to interrupt them right now.[lr]::
10935::$$$message_0085_0004_0002$$$::I sneak back out before they notice me.::
10936::$$$message_0085_0005_0000$$$::"Emiya, you were listening, weren't you?"[lr]::
10937::$$$message_0085_0005_0001$$$::When I left the archery range, Mitsuzuri called out to me from behind.::
10938::$$$message_0085_0006_0000$$$::"Oh, you noticed."[lr]::
10939::$$$message_0085_0006_0001$$$::"Yeah, I bet Matou didn't see you, though."[lr]::
10940::$$$message_0085_0006_0002$$$::"I see. Thanks for that."[lr]::
10941::$$$message_0085_0006_0003$$$::"I was definitely a bit overwhelmed."[lr]::
10942::$$$message_0085_0006_0004$$$::Mitsuzuri says and folds her arms.::
10943::$$$message_0085_0007_0000$$$::"...About Sakura?"[lr]::
10944::$$$message_0085_0007_0001$$$::"Huh? No. [cacheimage storage=美綴弓道着02c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 textoff=0 storage=美綴弓道着02c(中)]Weren't we talking about what to do about the sense of unity?"[lr]::
10945::$$$message_0085_0007_0002$$$::I'm not sure what she's talking about.::
10946::$$$message_0085_0008_0000$$$::"...Unity?"[lr]::
10947::$$$message_0085_0008_0001$$$::"Haha, what's with the look of incredulity?[lr]::
10948::$$$message_0085_0008_0002$$$::...Geddit? Your look rhymes with and matches with 'unity'? Anyway."[lr]::
10949::$$$message_0085_0008_0003$$$::You've been spending too much time around Fuji-nee. I'm intimately familiar with this kind of bad wordplay.::
10950::$$$message_0085_0009_0000$$$::"It's not my place to say this, but... [l][say storage=sch0148_mit_0061 name=美綴]She's not the type to lead those around her on her own, right?[lr]::
10951::$$$message_0085_0009_0001$$$::She has a part of her where she always takes a step back and respects everyone's opinion."::
10952::$$$message_0085_0010_0000$$$::"Is that bad?"[lr]::
10953::$$$message_0085_0010_0001$$$::"No. It's not bad at all, but she herself thinks that she doesn't want to be like that."[lr]::
10954::$$$message_0085_0010_0002$$$::"Oh, so she has wants as a leader. That's a good thing."::
10955::$$$message_0085_0011_0000$$$::"I'm also relieved in that sense.[lr]::
10956::$$$message_0085_0011_0001$$$::That's her problem if she wants to get out of her comfort zone and aim high."[lr]::
10957::$$$message_0085_0011_0002$$$::"That sense of unity?"[lr]::
10958::$$$message_0085_0011_0003$$$::"Yeah."::
10959::$$$message_0085_0012_0000$$$::"So... For example, if Matou is useless on the level of a Makidera, then they'll be like 'let's help the president together' but...lately, she's been so put together that she doesn't even show those kinds of flaws."::
10960::$$$message_0085_0013_0000$$$::"If she's too flawless, then the members would be less motivated or something?"[lr]::
10961::$$$message_0085_0013_0001$$$::She nods, a variety of emotions evident.::
10962::$$$message_0085_0014_0000$$$::"I don't think she's raising the kind of flag where the club would come together that well..."[lr]::
10963::$$$message_0085_0014_0001$$$::"A flag, huh..."[lr]::
10964::$$$message_0085_0014_0002$$$::Interesting choice of words there, Mitsuzuri. Reveals something about you, I'd say.[lr]::
10965::$$$message_0085_0014_0003$$$::...But a situation[line len=2]excuse me, a flag[line len=2]that would bring the club together, huh...::
10966::$$$message_0085_0015_0000$$$::As we consider, the bell rings.::
10967::$$$message_0085_0016_0000$$$::"We should go back to the classroom soon. Are you going to make it back on time dressed like that?"[lr]::
10968::$$$message_0085_0016_0001$$$::"I'm fine. I don't have a class for first period."[lr]::
10969::$$$message_0085_0016_0002$$$::"I see[line len=2][l][say storage=sch0148_shi_0101 name=士郎]Wait, no, hurry up!"[lr]::
10970::$$$message_0085_0016_0003$$$::"Wahahaha."::
10971::$$$message_0085_0017_0000$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]Still, big sister Mitsuzuri sure is considerate to come to morning practice and give Sakura advice even after she retired.::
10972::$$$message_0085_0018_0000$$$::"...Sense of unity, huh..."[lr]::
10973::$$$message_0085_0018_0001$$$::...Yeah. I'll tell her if I think of something.�o��